### 0. Login as Site Admin (uses docs/dummy-user.sql seeded admin@example.com)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "hunter2" }

> {%
  client.global.set("jwt", response.body.token);
%}

### 1. List system users (Admin only)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### 2. List media items in global catalog (Admin only)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/media-items
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
